    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "However, a new type of humour, which stems largely from U.S., has recently come into fashion.",
      "translation": "然而，一种主要源自美国的幽默最近开始流行。",
      "startTime": 63.16,
