    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "It is called 'sick humour'. Comedians base their jokes on tragic situations like violent death or serious accidents.",
      "translation": "这种幽默被称为“残酷幽默”。喜剧演员们把笑话建立在像暴力死亡或严重事故等悲剧性情景之上。",
      "startTime": 71.51,
