    {
      "id": "s13",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "From the moment he arrived there, he kept on pestering his doctor to tell him when he would be able to go home.",
      "translation": "从他到达那里的那一刻起，他就不断地纠缠医生，问他什么时候能回家。",
