    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Though the doctor did his best, the patient's recovery was slow.",
      "translation": "尽管医生尽了最大的努力，但病人的康复进度仍然很缓慢。",
      "startTime": 112.72,
      "endTime": 117.97,
      "analysis": {
