        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "On Christmas day, the man still had his right leg in plaster.",
      "translation": "圣诞节那天，那个人的右腿还打着石膏。",
      "startTime": 117.98,
      "endTime": 123.67,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "plaster",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "石膏，熟石膏"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "He spent a miserable day in bed thinking of all the fun he was missing.",
      "translation": "他在床上度过了痛苦的一天，想着他正在错过的所有乐趣。",
      "startTime": 123.68,
      "endTime": 129.43,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "miserable",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "痛苦的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The following day, however, the doctor consoled him by telling him that his chances of being able to leave hospital in time for New Year celebrations were good.",
      "translation": "然而，第二天，医生安慰他说，他能及时出院参加新年庆祝活动的可能性很大。",
      "startTime": 129.44,
      "endTime": 141.55,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "consoled",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "安慰"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The man took heart and sure enough, on New Year's Eve he was able to hobble along to a party.",
      "translation": "那人振作了精神。果然，在除夕那天，他能拄着拐杖去参加晚会了。",
      "startTime": 141.56,
      "endTime": 149.67,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "hobble",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "瘸着走"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "To compensate for his unpleasant experiences in hospital, the man drank a little more than was good for him.",
      "translation": "为了补偿他在医院里的不愉快经历，那个人喝得稍微多了一点。",
      "startTime": 149.68,
      "endTime": 158.27,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "compensate",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "补偿"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "In the process, he enjoyed himself thoroughly and kept telling everybody how much he hated hospitals.",
      "translation": "在这个过程中，他玩得很痛快，并不断告诉每个人他是多么讨厌医院。",
      "startTime": 158.28,
